{"c":[{"name":"20261004T170510Z-7982a134da3a9b97","text":"Swift String == is canonical equivalence (precomposed é equals e+U+0301): guards comparing field values must use .utf16.elementsEqual or digests, or a normalizing app passes a mismatched write (T1 RangeEdit.verify).","type":"note"},{"name":"20261004T170510Z-ca62d5f751cbf8cc","text":"NSSpellChecker requestChecking treats the orthography option as a starting point: with the system's automatic language on, French text passes under en and tres passes under fr (T1, macOS 26.6).","type":"note"}]}
